				<p>Welcome to our new blog! Here you will find information about what is going on within Kia and around our Phoenix area Kia dealership.  Be sure to check back as we add more content and news to the Salazar Kia &hellip; <a href="http://phoenixkia.salazarkia.com/1/hello-world/" >Continue reading <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>
